Short:    3 new utils + info for TransAmiga BBS
Uploader: neil@madhouz.demon.co.uk (Neil Barrett)
Author:   neil@madhouz.demon.co.uk (Neil Barrett)
Type:     comm/bbs

Following on from the success of CoolTAStuff,
CoolTABits contains utils and information for
the excellent TransAmiga BBS software.

TransAmiga Everything! v1.10
The latest version of the door that
displays over 40 pieces of user &
system information to the user.

TARGLIST Issue Two
A list of some TransAmiga Registered
Sysops and their BBS details

Global War Startup Script - The Next Generation
A new version of GlobalWar.trans, much smarter,
works properly with GW 2.x, and prevents hacking.

As well as this, there is the very latest details
on registering TransAmiga in the UK.
